  "prefLabel": "En 702.13 Water utility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 702.13 \"Water utility\" means any \"public utility\" as defined in RSA 362:2 owning, operating, or managing any plant or equipment or any part of the same for supplying of water to the public, or engaged in the transmission or sale of water ultimately sold to the public within New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #13912, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 700)",
